<figure id="S0.F1" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.01540v1/pic_lpo_demo.png" id="S0.F1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/439;" width="548" height="439" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 1: </span>Sample images generated from SDXL trained with Diffusion-LPO. Diffusion-LPO generalizes Diffusion-DPO by optimizing the preference under a list of ranked images. After finetuning with Diffusion-LPO, SDXL produces images with higher visual aesthetics and prompt alignments. </figcaption>
</figure>
